Chapter: BridgeWebPage
  cites Helm chapter HelmTypes
  cites Helm chapter HelmVoice
  cites Helm chapter BridgePage
  cites Foreword chapter StringUtils
  cites UI chapter Theme
  cites UI chapter Widget

 Browser front-end for The Bridge (voice command dashboard). Renders
 the BridgePage widget tree (shared UI components) through the common
 HTML widget runtime, and wires the admiral/captain controls to toggle
 voice state. The hierarchy is the same VoiceHierarchy the bare-metal
 app uses; per-node speaking/mute toggles are mirrored into flat render
 state so the dashboard reflects clicks without changing BridgePage.

